{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art of Platypus Reclayed</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>Platypus Reclayed</strong> with this captivating digital art book, a visual journey through the reimagining of the beloved claymation shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The book reveals the game's unique claymation aesthetic, featuring high-resolution images of the game's models, showcasing the intricate details of their handcrafted designs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the stunning artwork, you'll find an exclusive introduction by <strong>Platypus</strong> creator Anthony Flack and a behind-the-scenes look at his creative process, with images and descriptions that reveal how the game's claymation world was brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story behind the game's soundtrack with a special piece from Chris of C64Audio, and read about the dedicated community that inspired its development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This art book is an essential companion for fans of <strong>Platypus</strong> and anyone who appreciates the artistry and effort behind this one-of-a-kind game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025970?t=1758657101","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4025970?t=1758657101","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025970/c6631707c115ea834d4510e1d6bedf70fa2694ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758657101","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4025970/c6631707c115ea834d4510e1d6bedf70fa2694ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758657101","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Fu